{
    "title": "TripShot",
    "description": "TripShot helps you travel with ease! See all of your travel options in one place \u2013 bus/shuttle, on-demand rides, vanpool, bike share and more. Book a Reservation to secure your spot. Utilize Wallet to manage contactless payments and boarding. Set True-Time\u00ae notifications to know when your vehicle is arriving. (Options vary depending on your organization).\r\n\r\nTrue-Time\u00ae data provides up-to-the-second accuracy for vehicle locations and arrival times, ensuring you have the information you need exactly when you need it so you can arrive on time, stress-free.\r\n\r\nSimply download the app, log in securely with your account and you're ready to go!\r\n\r\nStandard Features:\r\n* Advanced Trip Planner - map out your journey from point A to B, know the route you\u2019re going to take and see when you will arrive. Set notifications to routes or stops to get True-Time\u00ae arrival, departure and delay information sent to your device. Favorite a route to make it easy to find next time you travel. \r\n* Routes - view specific information on all routes available to you including route schedules, route maps, and stop-by-stop details so you can plan every trip ahead of time.\r\n\r\nOptional Features:\r\n* On Demand - request an on-demand ride in your service area and get a real-time view of all available vehicles. \r\nReservations - from the Trip Planner book a reservation to secure your space for a future ride. \r\n* Boarding - for ticketless boarding utilize your device\u2019s Bluetooth and select Boarding to see your approaching vehicle and present your digital pass to the driver.\r\n* Wallet - utilize contactless payment in the Wallet for fare-based ticketing to securely purchase a transit ticket. Purchase tickets using Google Pay, Apple Pay, credit cards, and credit cards from pre-tax transit subsidy programs such as WageWorks and Commuter Benefits. \r\n* Micromobility - utilize your organization\u2019s shared scooters, bikes, e-bikes, and additional modes with a seamless user experience.\r\n\r\nFor additional resources and help go to our support page on TripShot.com or contact our support team at support@tripshot.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "TripShot helps you travel with ease! See all of your travel options in one place \u2013 bus/shuttle, on-demand rides, vanpool, bike share and more. Book a Reservation to secure your spot. Utilize Wallet to manage contactless payments and boarding. Set True-Time\u00ae notifications to know when your vehicle is arriving. (Options vary depending on your organization).<br><br>True-Time\u00ae data provides up-to-the-second accuracy for vehicle locations and arrival times, ensuring you have the information you need exactly when you need it so you can arrive on time, stress-free.<br><br>Simply download the app, log in securely with your account and you&#39;re ready to go!<br><br>Standard Features:<br>* Advanced Trip Planner - map out your journey from point A to B, know the route you\u2019re going to take and see when you will arrive. Set notifications to routes or stops to get True-Time\u00ae arrival, departure and delay information sent to your device. Favorite a route to make it easy to find next time you travel. <br>* Routes - view specific information on all routes available to you including route schedules, route maps, and stop-by-stop details so you can plan every trip ahead of time.<br><br>Optional Features:<br>* On Demand - request an on-demand ride in your service area and get a real-time view of all available vehicles. <br>Reservations - from the Trip Planner book a reservation to secure your space for a future ride. <br>* Boarding - for ticketless boarding utilize your device\u2019s Bluetooth and select Boarding to see your approaching vehicle and present your digital pass to the driver.<br>* Wallet - utilize contactless payment in the Wallet for fare-based ticketing to securely purchase a transit ticket. Purchase tickets using Google Pay, Apple Pay, credit cards, and credit cards from pre-tax transit subsidy programs such as WageWorks and Commuter Benefits. <br>* Micromobility - utilize your organization\u2019s shared scooters, bikes, e-bikes, and additional modes with a seamless user experience.<br><br>For additional resources and help go to our support page on TripShot.com or contact our support team at support@tripshot.com",
